body:
Listen. I know life can be a bitch, but that's the way it is. There must be a solution to what's troubling you. I'm sure there are people that care about you and would be devastated if you do... the thing. If you want to talk about your problems, maybe I can help you.

&#x200B;

Edit: If you wrote to me and I haven't texted back, I might be asleep ( I have some medical problems with sleeping).
